## 8. Health vs. Ambition Trade-offs

### What We Built (Ambition Realized)

✅ Depth Tracker (Priority #0)  
✅ Satellite View (The "God View")  
✅ Brain Consolidation (Sleep cycle)  
✅ Feature Map + Proofs (Ledger of work)  
✅ Session Management (Context preservation)  
✅ Full architecture synthesis (Meta-layer clarity)

### What We Deferred (Healthy Choices)

📌 Advanced session features → v0.5.0  
📌 CEO orchestration → v1.0+  
📌 Cross-editor sync → Future (documented as limitation)  
📌 Web UI → Terminal-first philosophy

**Analysis:** We shipped the 20% that delivers 80% of value. Deferred work is:
- Well-documented (INTENT files)
- Low-priority (not blocking user workflows)
- Reversible (can be built later without refactor)

