## 9. Risk Assessment

### Deployment Risks

| Risk | Mitigation | Severity |
|:-----|:-----------|:---------|
| CLI commands untested in prod | Mock tests passed | 🟡 Low |
| User must reinstall | Clear instructions in walkthrough | 🟢 None |
| Feature proofs untested | Generated one manually (crisis_detection) | 🟡 Low |

### Data Risks

| Risk | Mitigation | Severity |
|:-----|:-----------|:---------|
| Consolidation deletes wrong files | Archive-only (Tier 1), proposals-only (Tier 2) | 🟢 None |
| Session save corrupts data | JSON validation, error handling | 🟡 Low |
| Depth state persists incorrectly | Tested with 13 unit tests | 🟢 None |

### Technical Debt

| Debt | Impact | Plan |
|:-----|:-------|:-----|
| 15+ [.resolved](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/7c654df4-b83e-43f9-8620-f15868ec39d1/task.md.resolved) backup files | Disk space (minor) | `nucleus consolidate archive` |
| Mock-only verification for some features | Confidence gap | User will verify post-reinstall |
| No CI/CD pipeline | Manual testing burden | Acceptable for v0.4.0 |

**Verdict:** All risks are LOW or MITIGATED

